 "text": "Auditor | Christian County Missouri\nSkip to main content\nSkip to primary sidebar\nSearch this website\nChristian County Missouri\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nCounty Statistics\nMaps to Locations\nVideo Tours\nHow Do I…\nApply For\nAbsentee Voting\nBuilding Permit\nFood Stamps\nJob\nMerchant’s License\nSpecial Event Permit Process\nWIC\nLicense & Permits\nPay Online\nChild Support\nCourt Costs/Filing Fees\nPersonal Property Tax\nReal Estate Tax\nRecords\nBirth Certificates\nMarriage Certificates\nProperty Tax Receipt\nReal Estate Receipt\nRegister As\nSex Offender\nVoter\nRegister My\nStorm Shelter\nPhone in Mass Notification System\nSpecial Needs Relative\nReport\nChild Abuse\nCrime\nCounty Road Issue\nDrug/Crime Tip Line\nContact Us\nMain Menu\nAssessor\nPublic GIS Viewer\nGIS Registration\nSenate Bill 190 Application\nPersonal Property Online Filing\nAuditor\nCollector\nCommission\n2020 Census: Christian County Counts\nPurchasing\nEmergency Management\nHighways & Roads\nHuman Resources\nEmployment Application & Opportunities\nEmployee of the Quarter\nEmployee Suggestion\nMeetings & Agendas\nAppointed Boards\nLibrary Board of Trustees\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nAbsentee Voting\nChange Name or Address\nElection Calendar\nElection Results\nMilitary & Overseas Voters\nPolling Locations\nSample Ballots\nCourts\nProsecutor\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nPlanning & Development\nBuilding Regulations\nEnvironmental\nNational Flood Insurance\nRecycling\nAuditor\nAmy Dent\nThe Christian County Auditor is responsible for establishing, implementing, and monitoring the accounting and budgeting systems of Christian County.\nThe Christian County Auditor is responsible for preparing the County’s official financial statements and coordinating the annual financial audit.\nAs budget officer, the County Auditor is responsible for preparing and submitting a proposed annual budget to the County Commission, and preparing all related budget documents and schedules.\nBudgets\n2026 MO Budget Book\nProposed Budget Book\n2024 MO Budget Book\nMO Budget Book\nView the 2022 Budget\nView the 2021 Budget\nDownload the Approved 2020 Budget\nDownload the Approved 2019 Budget\nAudits\n2025 Audit of Christian County\n2024 Audit of Christian County\n2023 Audit of Christian County\n2022 Audit of Christian County\n2021 Audit of Christian County\n2020 Audit of Christian County\n2019 Audit of Christian County\n2018 Audit of Christian County\n2017 Audit of Christian County\n2016 Audit of Christian County\n2015 Audit of Christian County\n2014 Audit of Christian County\nPrimary Sidebar\nContact\nChristian County Auditor\nAmy Dent\nPhone: 417-582-4368\nWhistleblower Hotline\nHours of Operation\nBelow are the hours of operation for our offices, unless an office specifies differently.\nOpen 8:00 am – 4:30 PM\nMonday – Friday\nexcluding Federal & State Holidays\nHoliday Schedule\nThe Christian County Government offices will be closed for the following holidays by Order of the Christian County Commissioners\n01-01-2026 – New Year’s (Observed)\n01-19-2026 – Martin Luther King Jr Day\n02-12-2026 – Lincoln Day\n02-16-2026 – Presidents’ Day\n05-08-2026 – Truman Day\n05-25-2026 – Memorial Day\n06-19-2026 – Juneteenth Day\n07-03-2026 – Independence Day (Observed)\n09-07-2026 – Labor Day\n10-12-2026 – Columbus Day\n11-11-2026 – Veterans Day\n11-26-2026 – Thanksgiving Day\n11-27-2026 – Day after Thanksgiving\n12-25-2026 – Christmas Day\nCities in Christian County\nBillings\nClever\nFremont Hills\nHighlandville\nNixa\nOzark\nSparta\nVillage of Saddlebrooke\nChamber of Commerce\nNixa Chamber of Commerce\nOzark Chamber of Commerce\nRogersville Chamber of Commerce\nShow Me Christian County\nSparta Area Chamber of Commerce\nLocal News Agencies\nChristian County Headliner\nSpringfield News Leader\nSpringfield Business Journal\nQuick Links\nEmployee Portal\nDisabilities/ADA Grievance\nWebsite Accessibility\nSunshine Request Form\nChristian County Health Dept\nC